<http://data.silknow.org/object/cdf5857f-4511-39bd-a74b-1c0a60ea751c/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Furnishing fabric of yellow silk satin damask. Fragment of a large-scale design showing one vast stylised bloom and an ear of corn. The design is in satin and the background is 1/2 twill. There is a selvedge of multicoloured silks on one side. The repeat consists of two of these vast blooms and smaller ones, together with odd fruits and leaves on a fleshy stem."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/cdf5857f-4511-39bd-a74b-1c0a60ea751c> .

